  <Copyright Notice="© Avolites Ltd. 2021" />
  <History Date="03-03-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (poor documentation.  no pixel layout information.  42 channel mode appears to have two reset controls and no shutter.  makes no sense.)" Version="1" />
  <History Date="05-03-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="2" />
  <History Date="29-07-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised 42 channel mode to 43 channels in line with updated charts from customer.  Makes more sense." Version="3" />
  <History Date="29-11-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Reinstated the original 42 channel mode in response to customer feedback despite making little sense.  Presumably there is more than one version of this fixture/firmware." Version="4" />
